abstract: >-
  Offline Python replay and evaluation kit for native synchronized OES32
  telemetry frames: strict 32-channel contract, frozen thresholds from a
  separate calibration replay, and a clearly synthetic demo. Companion to
  OES-Resilience. No field-performance or superiority claims.
